# Minimal reproduction: a presumed issue A with an extra supporter sa that
# rests on a presumption of B, and B contested by a presumption of its
# refutation (B UNDEC). Grounded has one labelling, with A IN. Skeptical
# evaluation gives a value; credulous gives an OPEN term: the credulous
# tiebreak keeps the UNDEC supporter over the root presumption, which is IN,
# and B's presumption, labelled UNDEC, becomes an obligation.
lk.
declare A, B : bool.
declare b_a : (B -> A).
argument pa : (A).
by default.
dixi.
argument sa : (A).
cut (B -> A) t.
axiom b_a.
elim.
by default.
next.
axiom t.
dixi.
counterargument nb : (B).
by default.
dixi.
